	<h2>Description</h2>
<p><strong>Rod-Style Bubble Wall &#8220;Swirley&#8221; – New Image Works, Miami, Florida</strong></p>
<p>At New Image Works in Miami, Florida, Midwest-Tropical created a stunning rod-style bubble wall, affectionately known as “Swirley.” This dynamic custom feature brings modern artistry and a sense of movement to the space, blending functionality with a captivating aesthetic. Perfect for wellness centers, clinics, and upscale commercial interiors, this bubble wall turns any wall into a vibrant visual centerpiece.</p>
<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Unique Swirley Design:</strong> A stylized take on the traditional bubble wall, offering an artistic twist with rod-style construction.</li>
<li><strong>Soothing Motion:</strong> A continuous stream of bubbles delivers relaxation and visual intrigue.</li>
<li><strong>LED Lighting Effects:</strong> Integrated lighting with customizable color modes enhances the atmosphere.</li>
<li><strong>Durable Materials:</strong> Engineered using premium acrylic and metal for long-lasting impact.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>How to Get Your Own Water Feature</strong></p>
<ol>
<li><strong>Connect with Midwest-Tropical:</strong> Speak with design experts to explore the possibilities.</li>
<li><strong>Design to Fit Your Vision:</strong> Choose the right size, color lighting, bubble pattern, and branding options.</li>
<li><strong>Crafted with Precision:</strong> Your custom feature is built to the highest standards.</li>
<li><strong>Professional Installation:</strong> Seamless delivery and setup by experienced installers.</li>
</ol>
<p>Call 847-679-6666 or toll-free 1-888-365-2393 to begin.</p>
<p><strong>Customization Options:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Shape &amp; Dimensions:</strong> Designed to suit any wall or floor plan—ideal for reception areas or feature walls.</li>
<li><strong>Rod Style Configurations:</strong> Choose from straight, curved, or custom swirl effects.</li>
<li><strong>Lighting Customization:</strong> Dynamic LED lighting in your choice of colors and effects.</li>
<li><strong>Bubble Control:</strong> Adjustable airflow settings for bubble density and flow speed.</li>
<li><strong>Branding Elements:</strong> Add logos or design motifs to personalize the piece for your space.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Installation Process:</strong></p>
<ol>
<li><strong>Initial Consultation:</strong> Discuss your concept and site-specific requirements.</li>
<li><strong>CAD Renderings:</strong> Review and approve designs tailored to your project.</li>
<li><strong>High-Quality Fabrication:</strong> Built using state-of-the-art materials and techniques.</li>
<li><strong>Efficient On-Site Installation:</strong> Minimal disruption with professional care from start to finish.</li>
</ol>
<p><strong>A Signature Statement in Motion</strong></p>
<p>The <strong>Swirley rod-style bubble wall</strong> at New Image Works showcases how art, design, and wellness can meet in one fluid, mesmerizing feature.</p>
<p>Contact Midwest-Tropical today at 847-679-6666 or 1-888-365-2393 to get your custom bubble wall started.</p>
<p><strong>Fully Customizable:</strong> Bubble patterns, lighting, finishes, and dimensions are tailored to your brand and space.</p>
<p><strong>Clear Quotes:</strong> Receive detailed pricing, production, and delivery timelines from the start.</p>
